WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:17.016
"That blob is your bubble gum?" asked Roxy.

2
00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:23.788
"Yes!" cried Mara. "I blew a bubble, and it just grew and grew!"

3
00:00:23.789 --> 00:00:27.487
The blob rumbled again. Grarg!

4
00:00:27.488 --> 00:00:31.035
Roxy grabbed Mara and flew her to a safe spot.

5
00:00:31.036 --> 00:00:34.282
They landed on top of a tall building.

6
00:00:34.283 --> 00:00:37.045
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!" said Mara.

7
00:00:37.046 --> 00:00:39.744
"No problem," said Roxy.

8
00:00:39.745 --> 00:00:43.008
Roxy and Mara watched the blob grow some more.

9
00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:48.339
Grarg! It soon covered a whole city block!

10
00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:52.257
"What kind of bubble gum were you chewing?" asked Roxy.

11
00:00:52.258 --> 00:00:54.736
Mara pulled the pack out of her pocket.

12
00:00:54.737 --> 00:00:57.161
"It's a new kind," she said.

13
00:00:57.162 --> 00:01:00.488
"It's called 'Mrs. Wiggles Gum.'"

14
00:01:00.489 --> 00:01:03.095
"Mrs. Wiggles?" said Roxy.

15
00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:07.039
"She owns the new candy factory just outside Metro City.

16
00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.852
Maybe I should go talk to—"

17
00:01:08.853 --> 00:01:12.796
"Talk to whom?" said a voice from behind them.

18
00:01:12.797 --> 00:01:14.771
Roxy spun around.

19
00:01:14.772 --> 00:01:18.643
A tall woman with a tall hat stood there.

20
00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:21.386
"Who are you?" asked Roxy.

21
00:01:21.387 --> 00:01:25.653
"I am Mrs. Wiggles," said the woman.

22
00:01:25.654 --> 00:01:30.804
"Soon my bubble gum blob will cover the entire city!

23
00:01:30.805 --> 00:01:38.421
The blob will stay unless Mayor Bloom pays me one million dollars!"

24
00:01:38.422 --> 00:01:43.265
Roxy scowled. "That's what you think, Mrs. Wiggles!"

25
00:01:43.266 --> 00:01:45.620
Roxy took a step toward the villain.

26
00:01:45.621 --> 00:01:48.176
Just then Roxy heard a shout.

27
00:01:48.177 --> 00:01:50.696
"Help us, Rocket Girl!"

28
00:01:50.697 --> 00:01:52.758
Roxy looked down.

29
00:01:52.759 --> 00:01:55.282
Several people were stuck in the blob!

30
00:01:55.283 --> 00:01:57.301
Mrs. Wiggles laughed.

31
00:01:57.302 --> 00:02:01.406
"See you later, Rocket Girl!"

32
00:02:01.407 --> 00:02:04.368
The villain pulled a long rope from her coat.

33
00:02:04.369 --> 00:02:08.273
She threw it over the side of the building and zipped down.

34
00:02:08.274 --> 00:02:11.196
A truck shaped like a jelly bean was waiting for her.

35
00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:15.761
Mrs. Wiggles hopped in and sped off.

36
00:02:15.762 --> 00:02:19.840
Roxy looked at Mara. "You wait here!"

37
00:02:19.841 --> 00:02:23.897
Roxy shot down to the blob.

38
00:02:23.898 --> 00:02:26.067
She grabbed a man's arm.

39
00:02:26.068 --> 00:02:28.997
"Please help me, Rocket Girl!" said the man.

40
00:02:28.998 --> 00:02:32.364
"I don't want to be eaten by bubble gum!"

41
00:02:32.365 --> 00:02:34.976
"Just relax," said Roxy.

42
00:02:34.977 --> 00:02:39.081
"I'll get you out of here."

43
00:02:39.082 --> 00:02:42.227
Roxy pulled each person out of the blob.

44
00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:46.458
She flew each one to a safe spot.

45
00:02:46.459 --> 00:02:49.616
The blob stretched and grabbed more buildings.

46
00:02:49.617 --> 00:02:52.933
Soon all of downtown Metro City was covered.

47
00:02:52.934 --> 00:02:57.199
"I'm getting really tired of this dumb blob!" said Roxy.

48
00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:03.057
Whiz-hoo! She fired her eye laser beams. Ka-boom!

49
00:03:03.058 --> 00:03:07.137
The bubble gum blob exploded into hundreds of little pieces!

50
00:03:07.138 --> 00:03:10.740
Roxy smiled. "Good. No more—"

51
00:03:10.741 --> 00:03:13.484
Rumble! Rumble!

52
00:03:13.485 --> 00:03:17.323
Suddenly the earth shook, and loud rumbles filled the air.

53
00:03:17.324 --> 00:03:19.900
All of the tiny blobs were now moving.

54
00:03:19.901 --> 00:03:25.279
And they were all growing!

55
00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:34.434
Roxy gulped. "I think I just made things a whole lot worse!"
